<title>USA: Madison Cty Med Ctr, Miss., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Madison Cty Med Ctr, Miss., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co, Inc said it won $6.250 million of Madison County Medical Center, Miss., medical center revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 6.97 percent.</p>
